OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Asos customer told the BBC they were
OL,8,Fnow "scared to go into" the retailer's
OL,9,Fapp. Another, Jodie from Edinburgh,
OL,10,Fsaid "it's concerning if it's a data
OL,11,Fleak"
OL,13,FDid you get the notification? Here's
OL,14,Fwhat you should do
